Package: constechr
Title: Shared Functions for Conservation Technology Tools
Version: 0.0.0.9008
Authors@R: c(
    person("Shaun", "Astbury", , "shaun.astbury@natureconservancy.ca", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Nature Conservancy of Canada", role = "cph")
  )
Description: Functions shared by Conservation Technology (ConsTech) apps
    and pipelines to prepare and extract conservation data, such as
    aligning an area of interest to the national 1 km grid and extracting
    national data for it. Each function documents the method it uses, so
    results are consistent and repeatable across tools.
License: GPL (>= 3)
